*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.bin binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.basis binary
*.dds binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
